WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
Absolutely: you can also use it to manage your network.

2
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:10.890
In fact, I don't just use the Consultant for my personal problems

3
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.140
or my mental blocks,

4
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:17.180
but also with those team members who maybe give you curt answers.

5
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:22.680
You always start with an idea: maybe, in your mind, you're encouraging the team member, inviting them

6
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.630
to follow the training,

7
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.590
to do this, to do that,

8
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.740
and you end up, like in my case, with a team member who always gave you curt answers.

9
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.970
And I thought she didn't care at all,

10
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.740
and I didn't even know how to behave.

11
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:41.670
Thanks precisely to the Consultant we have inside RelAI

12
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:47.470
I did a simulation of what I should say to this person.

13
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:53.610
I went into the call, I followed the advice the Consultant gave me,

14
00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.110
and now this person books that half hour with me every week,

15
00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.840
because she told me: «That half hour is what I need to move my work forward

16
00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.250
and my goals.»

17
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.360
For three years this person had been in my team, and she was always stuck.

18
00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:16.640
So absolutely: you can also build the relationship with your team.
